# stoppable_things.voc — Things that can STOP — vehicles, machines, bodily/biological processes,
# flows. As the subject or object of 'para' they support parar (VERB): 'o comboio
# PARA', 'pára a máquina'. The richest semantic list for para — add any entity that
# can come to a stop (use the canonical European-Portuguese noun).
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

